    "Nonzero residual moment never silently reuses first-row net-tension or inter-row shear-out demand assumptions.",
    "Eccentric block shear uses the total in-plane connection resultant only when the existing block-shear force-line/path context is proven compatible.",
    "Known supported-check failure remains FAIL even when required group checks are unsupported.",
    "Supported-check PASS plus unsupported required group checks never becomes ordinary PASS.",
    "Member-end moments are not silently transferred.",
    "Out-of-plane force does not generate bolt-axis tension or prying.",
    "Display-unit changes do not alter compatibility classification, demand, resistance, status, or fingerprint."
